# ==============================================================================
# Rule Name: Apple-Direct (Custom)
# Description: Baseline Apple services requiring DIRECT connection
# Scope: iCloud, CloudKit, App Store, Apple ID, HomeKit, Apple Music, Apple Dev, OTA
# Strict Restriction: DO NOT blanket route apple.com, 17.0.0.0/8, or Apple CDN to proxy
# ==============================================================================

# --- iCloud & CloudKit Sync ---
# Target: Apple CloudKit sync endpoints for third-party apps (爱乐记, 猿音) & iOS Photos
# Evidence: iOS CloudKit synchronization telemetry, 2026-09-28
# Reason: Direct routing ensures instant bi-directional CloudKit sync and prevents sync hangs
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple-cloudkit.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,icloud-content.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,icloud.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,icloud.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple-livephotoskit.com

# --- App Store & Apple ID ---
# Target: App Store downloads, icons, and Apple Account authentication
# Evidence: App Store app updates and Apple ID sign-in trace, 2026-09-28
# Reason: Direct connection to local Apple CDN nodes avoids throttling
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apps.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mzstatic.com
DOMAIN,identity.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,appleid.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,appleid.cdn-apple.com

# --- Apple Music ---
# Target: Apple Music streaming audio stream CDN
# Evidence: Apple Music lossless/spatial audio playback trace, 2026-09-28
# Reason: Domestic CDN direct playback prevents audio buffering
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,music.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,audio-ssl.itunes.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,blobstore.apple.com

# --- Core Infrastructure & Hardware / Firmware / OTA ---
# Target: iOS OTA software updates, Game Center, and Apple captive portal
# Evidence: iOS System Settings OTA update check, 2026-09-28
# Reason: Fast OTA downloads from local cache nodes
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gc.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple-dns.net
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cdn-apple.com
DOMAIN,konut-cdn.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,swcdn.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,updates-http.cdn-apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,mesu.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gg.apple.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,gnip.apple.com

# --- Apple China Local CDN Cache ---
# Target: Official Apple China CDN IPv4 subnet
# Evidence: Apple official documentation on China CDN cache IPs, 2026-09-28
# Reason: Domestic CDN acceleration
IP-CIDR,17.248.128.0/17,no-resolve
